# Engineering methods standards receipts

Shared DEC-EMV-003 receipts for the DEC-EMV-002 standards spine. Later D1–D4
references cite a `row_id` from this file. This file does not author those
skills, does not rewrite `plan-spec`, and does not release, publish, or
announce (CONTRACT-EMV-022). See [COE index](../../../docs/coe/index.md).

Retrieval date for every row: **2026-09-09**. Precedence numbers match the
technical-plan Authority and precedence list (owner decisions are rank 1 and
are Journey authority, not a spine-source row).

Access class is the strongest evidence actually obtained for that source:

| access_class | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| full-text | The official document bytes were retrieved. |
| public-excerpt | Issuer catalog abstract, title page, or public TOC was retrieved; the licensed body was not. |
| metadata-only | Bibliographic catalog fields only; no licensed body and no clause inventory. |

Do not treat metadata-only or public-excerpt rows as clause coverage. NASA and
INCOSE handbook body, including NASA Appendices C, G, H, I, and L, is paraphrased
or named only. Local AZEdge `.sysml` files are fixtures, not OMG authority.

