candidate_ref: "'`plan/2026-10-11-amazon-fantasy-companion` at `2c13a6bf560e87d11864cc6234f48e40dd9cf529`, plus the untracked planning package. Technical plan: `docs/plans/2026-10-11-amazon-fantasy-companion/amazon-fantasy-companion-technical-plan.md`; sha256: `b0f42a1b844e7b40917c46fd5afcf790d6c78bb2cb41760a1c3cc3420ca5b693`.

