blocker: **none** for this requirement-register gate. This is correction round 1, named `receipt-r2.md` as requested; it is not a second correction, integrated owner acceptance, implementation assurance, or publication.

## Per-row findings

| ID | class | defect | proposed statement |
|---|---|---|---|
| None | — | No applied-incorrectly, introduced-defect or unresolved-dependency finding remains. | None; no further row change proposed. |

## PASS rows

Every row was inspected for its statement, source/rationale, verification method and allocation. The 35 round-0 PASS dispositions were checked for change impact without reopening style preferences. Plan line numbers below refer to the hashed technical plan; design line numbers refer to `design.md` sha256 `f4ee3cbdc86a163021fc32de63f0d62e5697a437dceff3041a4ecead18e9f10f`.

| UID | Result | Note |
|---|---|---|
