footer='''

## Owner questions

None required by this re-gate. Existing OD-AFC decisions remain for the integrated review. This PASS neither answers them nor accepts a future failed spike as an equivalent product outcome. No further correction round is requested.

## Decision coverage

uncovered: none introduced by this correction. The round-0 topic/disposition inventory is retained: issue #1, settled SD decisions including SD-022 superseding SD-013, C1..C14 and D1..D5. The reverse-diff check establishes that the correction changes exactly the 46 cited rows plus the Risk table header/separator; no row, source topic, quantity definition, exclusion or owner-decision section was removed. Scope coverage here carries forward the prior gate's source inventory; this is not a new external-source or vendor-capability review.

## Correction evidence

